WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.201
Write beside your world. Start a book and link a place directly inside your chapter.

2
00:00:03.201 --> 00:00:09.909
Open Write → Manuscript to start a book in this world.

3
00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:17.751
Choose New book and give it a title.

4
00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:25.610
Add a chapter to begin drafting.

5
00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:30.980
Write your opening. The chapter saves as you work.

6
00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:34.964
Type [[ and the start of a place name to search your world.

7
00:00:34.964 --> 00:00:41.107
Select the place to add a link inside your prose.

8
00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:46.033
Wait for Saved. Your chapter and its place link are kept together.
